# Fact or Fiction with nothing left to reveal: Bot1's library holds one card, drawn at the start of turn 3, so when it
# casts the spell the library is empty, nothing is revealed (CR 609.3: a library that has fewer cards shows what it has,
# and an empty one shows nothing), no card moves anywhere and the spell simply goes to the graveyard. What the scenario
# proves is that state, not that no question is asked - a question answered by default would leave the same state.

